        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Lenny’s owner, Valerie Musser, wrote the book. She is a chef and lizard lover. The idea of the book came after she bought Lenny a little chef’s hat. He loves wearing hats and "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "posing",
            "zh": "摆姿势"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " for photos. So, Valerie started making tiny food for him."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "“He loves to be in the kitchen,” said Valerie. “It’s his favourite room in the house, so it "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "worked out",
            "zh": "进展顺利"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
